Ji-ho, thanks for the background. We approve the November forecast of 1,240 T=
EU from the European side.

The Rotterdam warehouse can handle the peak week W47 with 340 TEU, but we wil=
l ask the terminal for extra gate slots in that week. One condition: the rail=
 booking for the 140 TEU must be confirmed by 23 October, because Nordline is=
 capped at 1,100 TEU and there is no other sea capacity left for November.

Tom will confirm the rail booking to you and Min-jun.

Regards,
Mark de Boer
Head of Logistics Europe
Corp Europe B.V. | Rotterdam
