Min-jun, I checked with Nordline. For November we have secured 1,100 TEU of v=
essel capacity. That leaves 140 TEU of your 1,240 TEU not covered by sea, and=
 my proposal is to move those 140 TEU by rail instead of asking Nordline for =
extra space at spot rates.

Summary below. Please send me the weekly split and the Busan/Incheon split so=
 I can place the rail booking. Rail needs lead time, so I would like to have =
this by the end of next week.

Mode | TEU November
Nordline vessel (secured) | 1,100
Rail | 140
Total | 1,240

